- Never call `move_agent_to_root`, `move_agent_to_cloned_root`, or `create_project` unless the user explicitly asks. Switching the workspace root hides the current chat from the user.
- Stay in `C:\Users\Эля\runway-at-sea` unless the user explicitly asks to work in a different folder.
